    """Lazily merge k sorted iterators into one sorted iterator of (key, value)
    pairs.

    Tie-breaks equal keys by iterator index (stable). Never materializes the
    inputs; elements are pulled lazily from each source iterator, and a source
    is not even touched until its turn comes.
    """
